                                          "text":  "Similar to how you cut out the grid in the mindhead room, I want these windows to be cut out in a similar way, but they should be transparent with 30# opacity of the current pale porrtion of the glass. Then, I want warm light to flood though the grid at an angle that comes in and descends toward the ground for all windows on this side.",
